    title: "Cloud computing for Nigerian businesses: beyond the buzzword",
    excerpt:
      "Cloud is not just for big companies. Here is what it actually means for Nigerian SMEs and where to start.",
    category: "Technology",
    author: "Ellis Dennis Graham",
    role: "Founder & Lead Instructor",
    authorPhoto: "/images/team/ellis.jpg",
    heroImage: "/images/blog/cloud-computing.jpg",
