      "The opportunity is real. So are the challenges. Here is what we have seen work for Nigerian tech freelancers.",
    category: "Career",
    author: "Ellis Dennis Graham",
    role: "Founder & Lead Instructor",
    authorPhoto: "/images/team/ellis.jpg",
    heroImage: "/images/blog/freelancing-nigeria.jpg",
